window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Tamsin's city is safe. She's married Paige, the love of her live. Now all they need is some time to themselves. What could possibly go wrong?</p> <p>The newly married leader of the Santa Cruz werewolf pack and her wife decide to travel to Paris and London to celebrate their nuptials. Everything is set for their romantic getaway. In between the pain de chocolat and fish and chips, the two see nothing but romance and full bellies.</p> <p>When they arrive abroad, visiting the sites and friends is everything they hoped for, until they learn that witches and wolves are still at war in other parts of the world. Then Paige goes missing. Can Tamsin convince the foreign rivals to see past their animosity to help her find her mate?</p> <p>Follow Tamsin and Paige on this final journey into the lives of the pack from Santa Cruz.</p>"; 
